    \ref section_compile_peano4_for_exaparty "here".
    - For instructions on how to get started with ExaParty, check the
    \ref exaparty_tutorials site
    - A series of tests, including ready-to-go examples intended to verify the
    physics solvers, are described on the \ref exaparty_tests page. Running those
    physics tests (located in `/tests/exaparty/hydro-simple-sph-physics`) is a good
    starting point to get familiar with ExaParty.
    - For documentation of some ready-to-go benchmarks, check the \ref exaparty_benchmarks page.
    - How to plot results is explained in \ref exaparty_visualisation
